  "body": "This is one source of confusion for Blob vs. File in toBlob():\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/378\n\nMake the callback's blob argument nullable, as the toBlob() method\ncan call the callback with null if there are no pixels:\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-canvas-toblob\n",
